{
	"name": "Bi-Way: review request with routing",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Review request with routing\nThe day after a visit, asks for a rating from 1 to 5. Happy customers (4 or 5) get the link to your Google reviews; unhappy ones (1 or 2) are reported to your team by email, and get an answer saying you will contact them.\n\n### Setup\n1. **Bi-Way API** credential. An RCS agent launched by the French operators (check it with the Bi-Way node: RCS Agent › Get Status). Without one, set the channel of the Bi-Way nodes to your SMS channel, and Content to Text where they send a card: the buttons are then left out.\n2. Google Sheet with a tab **Visits** and the columns `Date` (YYYY-MM-DD), `First name`, `Phone` (international format). Format these columns as **Plain text** in Google Sheets, so that it keeps the `+` of the phone numbers and the dates as written. Replace `YOUR_SHEET_ID`.\n3. Replace `https://g.page/r/YOUR_PLACE_ID/review` by the review link of your Google Business Profile.\n4. SMTP credential for the alert; replace `team@example.com`. Publish the workflow.",
				"height": 400,
				"width": 520
			},
			"id": "642767a4-ccc8-4fb3-ac01-8e8ce505490b",
			"name": "Sticky Note setup",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-80,
				-480
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "### Two entry points\nThe top branch sends the request. The bottom branch starts on every received message and only keeps ratings: a tapped button (`RATE_1` … `RATE_5`) or a figure typed in an SMS.",
				"height": 160,
				"width": 380
			},
			"id": "8d69de5a-237f-4dd6-af44-2dd0e9960954",
			"name": "Sticky Note rating",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				700,
				-360
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"rule": {
					"interval": [
						{
							"field": "days",
							"triggerAtHour": 10
						}
					]
				}
			},
			"id": "3779bd8b-fb84-4d6e-a331-ef0231394214",
			"name": "Every day at 10 am",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1.2,
			"position": [
				0,
				0
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"documentId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
					"mode": "id"
				},
				"sheetName": {
					"__rl": true,
					"value": "Visits",
					"mode": "name"
				},
				"filtersUI": {
					"values": [
						{
							"lookupColumn": "Date",
							"lookupValue": "={{ $now.minus({ days: 1 }).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "ec850e4a-e26a-43d5-adb8-9f1c38a48183",
			"name": "Get yesterday's visits",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
			"typeVersion": 4.5,
			"position": [
				220,
				0
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "message",
				"operation": "send",
				"channel": "rcs",
				"content": "text",
				"source": "raw",
				"body": "=Hello {{ $json['First name'] }}, how was your visit yesterday? Tap a rating.",
				"receiver": "={{ $json.Phone }}",
				"options": {},
				"rcsButtons": {
					"reply": [
						{
							"keyword": "RATE_5",
							"text": "★★★★★"
						},
						{
							"keyword": "RATE_4",
							"text": "★★★★"
						},
						{
							"keyword": "RATE_3",
							"text": "★★★"
						},
						{
							"keyword": "RATE_2",
							"text": "★★"
						},
						{
							"keyword": "RATE_1",
							"text": "★"
						}
					]
				},
				"rcsFallback": "custom",
				"rcsFallbackText": "=How was your visit yesterday? Reply with a mark from 1 (bad) to 5 (excellent)."
			},
			"id": "a3aa133d-fbff-4473-a220-feb009a6226c",
			"name": "Ask for a rating",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-biway-messenger.biway",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				460,
				0
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"events": [
					"MESSENGER_DELIVERY"
				]
			},
			"id": "e6f1a718-4aeb-4816-a518-7749c01ec442",
			"name": "Message received",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-biway-messenger.biwayTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				0,
				360
			],
			"webhookId": "ce135d84-20bf-43d0-a701-4e66052bf779"
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"assignments": {
					"assignments": [
						{
							"id": "4abd3e14-8d0a-4c8e-a98e-db7332ff961c",
							"name": "rating",
							"value": "={{ Number((String($json.keyword || '').match(/^RATE_([1-5])$/) || String($json.message || '').trim().match(/^([1-5])$/) || [])[1] || 0) }}",
							"type": "number"
						},
						{
							"id": "d33f1cf7-a05c-44a9-a5a9-eff525ac88b7",
							"name": "phone",
							"value": "={{ $json.address }}",
							"type": "string"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "adeccdbb-39ec-443f-a433-a7c05300706e",
			"name": "Read the rating",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
			"typeVersion": 3.4,
			"position": [
				220,
				360
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"rules": {
					"values": [
						{
							"conditions": {
								"options": {
									"caseSensitive": false,
									"leftValue": "",
									"typeValidation": "loose",
									"version": 2
								},
								"conditions": [
									{
										"id": "9aa7cc03-0278-4453-a4a1-b42dcb246c01",
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.rating }}",
										"rightValue": 4,
										"operator": {
											"type": "number",
											"operation": "gte"
										}
									}
								],
								"combinator": "or"
							},
							"renameOutput": true,
							"outputKey": "Happy (4-5)"
						},
						{
							"conditions": {
								"options": {
									"caseSensitive": false,
									"leftValue": "",
									"typeValidation": "loose",
									"version": 2
								},
								"conditions": [
									{
										"id": "64bcccc9-1cee-48d8-a684-c4d153e75d1a",
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.rating }}",
										"rightValue": 1,
										"operator": {
											"type": "number",
											"operation": "gte"
										}
									},
									{
										"id": "4332496d-ade9-4701-a665-575870a09c8b",
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.rating }}",
										"rightValue": 2,
										"operator": {
											"type": "number",
											"operation": "lte"
										}
									}
								],
								"combinator": "and"
							},
							"renameOutput": true,
							"outputKey": "Unhappy (1-2)"
						},
						{
							"conditions": {
								"options": {
									"caseSensitive": false,
									"leftValue": "",
									"typeValidation": "loose",
									"version": 2
								},
								"conditions": [
									{
										"id": "5f50b542-b3e8-4cd5-ad11-acdcd5b11143",
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.rating }}",
										"rightValue": 3,
										"operator": {
											"type": "number",
											"operation": "equals"
										}
									}
								],
								"combinator": "or"
							},
							"renameOutput": true,
							"outputKey": "Neutral (3)"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "cca51c5d-fd72-46ee-a4a0-23cf5d25403c",
			"name": "Route by rating",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
			"typeVersion": 3.2,
			"position": [
				440,
				360
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "message",
				"operation": "send",
				"channel": "rcs",
				"content": "text",
				"source": "raw",
				"body": "Thank you! Would you share your opinion on Google? It helps us a lot.",
				"receiver": "={{ $json.phone }}",
				"options": {},
				"rcsButtons": {
					"openUrl": [
						{
							"text": "Leave a review",
							"url": "https://g.page/r/YOUR_PLACE_ID/review"
						}
					]
				},
				"rcsFallback": "custom",
				"rcsFallbackText": "Thank you! Would you share your opinion on Google? https://g.page/r/YOUR_PLACE_ID/review"
			},
			"id": "fbaf7a2b-d0f0-4b8f-aaf0-2576dfa4b926",
			"name": "Invite to a Google review",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-biway-messenger.biway",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				700,
				200
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"fromEmail": "n8n@example.com",
				"toEmail": "team@example.com",
				"subject": "=Unhappy customer: {{ $json.rating }}/5",
				"emailFormat": "text",
				"text": "=The customer {{ $json.phone }} rated their visit {{ $json.rating }}/5. Please contact them.",
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "de1a0e6d-5d5f-4410-adcf-66cf71bdf91f",
			"name": "Alert the team",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
			"typeVersion": 2.1,
			"position": [
				700,
				400
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "message",
				"operation": "send",
				"channel": "rcs",
				"content": "text",
				"source": "raw",
				"body": "We are sorry your visit did not go well. Someone from our team will contact you.",
				"receiver": "={{ $('Route by rating').item.json.phone }}",
				"options": {},
				"rcsFallback": "custom",
				"rcsFallbackText": "We are sorry your visit did not go well. Someone from our team will contact you."
			},
			"id": "c9d697ba-748c-4113-adad-ae0c9fc5ab76",
			"name": "Answer the unhappy customer",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-biway-messenger.biway",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				920,
				400
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "message",
				"operation": "send",
				"channel": "rcs",
				"content": "text",
				"source": "raw",
				"body": "Thank you for your feedback!",
				"receiver": "={{ $json.phone }}",
				"options": {},
				"rcsFallback": "custom",
				"rcsFallbackText": "Thank you for your feedback!"
			},
			"id": "a712e14e-cafd-42a7-a23a-da4dff4cd74c",
			"name": "Thank for the feedback",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-biway-messenger.biway",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				700,
				600
			]
		}
	],
